    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>对等原则</>\n阿罗德斯遵循一问一答的对等原则，阿罗德斯的问题可以被拒绝或者积攒，但一定要被解决。\n若拒绝回答问题、回答错误或者撒谎，将会受到阿罗德斯的惩罚。\n阿罗德斯回答完毕以及提出的问题被解决后，才能再次发起提问。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>NPC说明</>\n阿罗德斯NPC的认知范围限制于诡秘之主世界观，在与阿罗德斯交流跨越时代背景或者思维跳脱的话题，阿罗德斯可能无法进行回答，敬请谅解。\n阿罗德斯NPC的回答均由AI模型生成，回答结果可能会出现内容模糊和偏差，可以通过对话框的举报按钮，进行对应反馈，帮助我们丰富阿罗德斯的体验效果。\n若同时互动玩家人数过高，阿罗德斯可能会出现响应时间过长的现象，在短暂等待后即可恢复。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Principle of Reciprocity</>\n Arrodes follows the principle of reciprocity: one question for one answer. Arrodes' questions can be refused or accumulated, but they must be resolved.\n If you refuse to answer a question, answer incorrectly, or lie, you will be punished by Arrodes.\n You can only initiate a new question after Arrodes has finished answering and the question posed by Arrodes has been resolved.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> NPC Note</>\n The Arrodes NPC's knowledge is limited to the Lord of Mysteries worldview. Arrodes may not be able to answer questions that transcend the era or involve abstract, jumping logic. We appreciate your understanding.\n The Arrodes NPC's answers are generated by an AI model, and results may be vague or inaccurate. You can use the report button in the chat box to provide feedback, helping us enrich Arrodes' experience.\n If too many players are interacting with Arrodes simultaneously, there may be a delay in response. It will recover after a short wait.",
